---
const phases = [
  {
    number: "01",
    name: "入弯",
    action: "刹车 → 松刹车",
    question: "车头愿不愿意转？",
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    name: "弯中",
    action: "维持速度与转向",
    question: "哪一轴先失去抓地？",
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    name: "出弯",
    action: "回正 → 加油",
    question: "动力能否平稳落地？",
  },
]
---

<aside class="setup-overview" aria-label="调教的阅读起点">
  <p class="setup-eyebrow">GARAGE NOTES <span>公路赛车 · GT3</span></p>
  <p class="setup-overview-title">先找到问题发生在哪一段。</p>
  <p class="setup-overview-description">
    同样是“推头”，重刹入弯、高速弯中和加油出弯，可能需要完全不同的调整。
  </p>
  <ol class="setup-phases">
    {phases.map((phase) => (
      <li>
        <span class="setup-phase-number" aria-hidden="true">{phase.number}</span>
        <div>
          <strong>{phase.name}</strong>
          <span class="setup-phase-action">{phase.action}</span>
          <p>{phase.question}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <p class="setup-reading-path">
    阅读路线 <span>理解抓地 → 查参数 → 按症状排查 → 上赛道验证</span>
  </p>
  <p class="setup-mobile-hint">较宽的参数表可以左右滑动查看。</p>
</aside>

<style>
  .setup-overview {
    margin-block: var(--space-l) var(--space-xl);
    padding-block: var(--space-m);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .setup-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .setup-eyebrow span {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .setup-overview-title {
    margin-block: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 550;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .setup-overview-description {
    max-inline-size: 34rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--prose-foreground);
  }

  .setup-phases {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin-block: var(--space-m);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--muted) 38%, transparent);
  }

  .setup-phases li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1rem 0.85rem;
  }

  .setup-phases li + li {
    border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .setup-phase-number {
    padding-block-start: 0.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .setup-phases strong {
    display: block;
    margin-block-end: 0.25rem;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  .setup-phase-action,
  .setup-phases p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--prose-foreground);
  }

  .setup-phases p {
    margin-block-start: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .setup-reading-path {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .setup-reading-path span {
    color: var(--prose-foreground);
  }

  .setup-mobile-hint {
    display: none;
    margin-block-start: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  @media (width < 38rem) {
    .setup-mobile-hint {
      display: block;
    }

    .setup-phases {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .setup-phases li {
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    }

    .setup-phases li + li {
      border-inline-start: 0;
      border-block-start: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .setup-phases strong {
      display: inline;
      margin-inline-end: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
